1
00:00:03,603 --> 00:00:06,873
Oh, hey, we ran into your
mom at Benihana last night.

2
00:00:06,874 --> 00:00:08,644
Uh, yeah, she loves that place.

3
00:00:08,642 --> 00:00:10,472
(Howard:)Every time they flip
a shrimp in the air,

4
00:00:10,478 --> 00:00:13,048
(Howard:)she practically leaps out
of her seat to catch it.

5
00:00:14,015 --> 00:00:16,115
(Howard:)That's why I don't take her
to SeaWorld.

6
00:00:17,551 --> 00:00:18,981
(Leonard:)I know you-you don't
want to hear it,

7
00:00:18,986 --> 00:00:20,016
(Leonard:)but she was there with Stuart.

8
00:00:20,021 --> 00:00:21,291
(Howard:)That's fine.

9
00:00:21,288 --> 00:00:22,658
(Howard:)I don't care.

10
00:00:22,656 --> 00:00:24,686
(Rajj:)It doesn't bug you when
they go out on dates?

11
00:00:24,692 --> 00:00:25,992
(Howard:)They're not dating.

12
00:00:25,993 --> 00:00:28,963
(Howard:)They're just two friends
who went out to dinner.

13
00:00:28,963 --> 00:00:30,793
(Raj:)And then went back
to the home they share

14
00:00:30,798 --> 00:00:31,968
(Raj:)where they probably fell asleep

15
00:00:31,966 --> 00:00:33,466
(Raj:)in the matching pajamas
she got them

16
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:36,097
(Raj:)because they both
just love penguins.

17
00:00:37,671 --> 00:00:40,171
(Howard:)Hey, lots of people
wear matching pajamas

18
00:00:40,174 --> 00:00:41,304
(Howard:)who aren't dating.

19
00:00:41,308 --> 00:00:44,108
(Raj:)Like who?
Like you and your dog.

20
00:00:45,980 --> 00:00:48,550
(Leonard:)Don't rule out the dating.

21
00:00:48,549 --> 00:00:51,079
(Howard:)Fine, it bothers me.

22
00:00:51,085 --> 00:00:53,155
(Howard:)You happy?

23
00:00:53,154 --> 00:00:54,724
(Sheldon:)You think you've got problems.

24
00:00:54,722 --> 00:00:58,562
(Sheldon:)The gibbon is the only member
of the ape family not classified

25
00:00:58,559 --> 00:01:01,359
(Sheldon:)as a great ape.

26
00:01:01,362 --> 00:01:03,392
(Howard:)How is this helpful?

27
00:01:03,397 --> 00:01:05,997
(Sheldon:)All the non-human apes
are classified

28
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,600
(Sheldon:)as great apes except one.

29
00:01:07,601 --> 00:01:10,901
(Sheldon:)That means taxonomists created
the entire category

30
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,875
(Sheldon:)of lesser ape just
to single out the poor gibbon

31
00:01:13,874 --> 00:01:16,504
(Sheldon:)as the weird kid
on the playground.

32
00:01:16,510 --> 00:01:20,680
(Sheldon:)Now there's a hairy little
fellow with a genuine beef.

33
00:01:20,681 --> 00:01:23,581
(Leonard:)But the gibbon doesn't know
what it's categorized as.

34
00:01:23,584 --> 00:01:25,184
(Leonard:)It doesn't even know
it's called a gibbon.

35
00:01:25,186 --> 00:01:27,186
(Sheldon:)True.

36
00:01:27,188 --> 00:01:29,688
(Sheldon:)Sorry, kid, you've got it
worse than a gibbon.

37
00:01:31,725 --> 00:01:35,225
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

